{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portabellows is an adventure of <strong>exploration</strong> and a <strong>collectathon</strong>. Find recipes and ingredients to bake pies, and help quirky castaway residents off the island. Discover the mystery of what's keeping them there. New abilities will help you access more and more whimsical areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Erma, retired, relaxing by the beach in your quiet island paradise when you see a <strong>plane falling out of the sky</strong>. There starts your adventure, following clues as to where the plane landed (certainly not in one piece) and help out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help new friends by collecting everything\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>jelly beans</strong> in the world to trade with a shopkeeper for <strong>seeds</strong>, useful items and upgrades. Complete collections that your new friends need or desire: missing plane pieces, relics and more, they'll reward you with mementos that'll help you get to know them. Go above and beyond in your collecting to get rewarded with cute <strong>outfits!</strong>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Platforming Fun\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore every corner of the island: jump, sprint, swim, and more to traverse scenic landscapes full of all sorts of <strong>mushrooms </strong>(including giant portobello mushrooms!). Procure new <strong>abilities</strong> by exploring every path. Be victorious in challenge rooms, mysteriously in place to recover <strong>lost treasures</strong>: platforming challenges and puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather ingredients to bake pies fit for a hungry glutton </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find them in every nook and cranny of the island. Obtain eggs as a reward for reuniting lost chicklings with their mama. Fill in the pages of your <strong>journal </strong>and <strong>recipe book</strong>, discovering lost pages featuring location hints of ancient recipes and other secrets!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pie Making </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your ingredients to bake delicious pies step by step. Delight in seeing each unique pie\u2019s delicious result. Wonder who those pie orders are for?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a team of two, this is our passion project and we can't wait for you to enjoy your time in Portabellows! We hope to tickle your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2339000?t=1772051020","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772051020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/e94ad41621a6089ffcaecf13070190f0c2c9c556/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772051020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/e94ad41621a6089ffcaecf13070190f0c2c9c556/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772051020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portabellows is an adventure of <strong>exploration</strong> and a <strong>collectathon</strong>. Find recipes and ingredients to bake pies, and help quirky castaway residents off the island. Discover the mystery of what's keeping them there. New abilities will help you access more and more whimsical areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/99db960f426885557e5ee53fc81bde4b.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Erma, retired, relaxing by the beach in your quiet island paradise when you see a <strong>plane falling out of the sky</strong>. There starts your adventure, following clues as to where the plane landed (certainly not in one piece) and help out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/0f6e884006ade69129324a3cb53df0c1.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help new friends by collecting everything\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>jelly beans</strong> in the world to trade with a shopkeeper for <strong>seeds</strong>, useful items and upgrades. Complete collections that your new friends need or desire: missing plane pieces, relics and more, they'll reward you with mementos that'll help you get to know them. Go above and beyond in your collecting to get rewarded with cute <strong>outfits!</strong>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Platforming Fun\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/166bedbe57a30237bb245b98a9ff061a.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore every corner of the island: jump, sprint, swim, and more to traverse scenic landscapes full of all sorts of <strong>mushrooms </strong>(including giant portobello mushrooms!). Procure new <strong>abilities</strong> by exploring every path. Be victorious in challenge rooms, mysteriously in place to recover <strong>lost treasures</strong>: platforming challenges and puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather ingredients to bake pies fit for a hungry glutton </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.poster.avif?t=1772051020\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.webm?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/extras/943a0273116d34322475e082632c4971.mp4?t=1772051020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find them in every nook and cranny of the island. Obtain eggs as a reward for reuniting lost chicklings with their mama. Fill in the pages of your <strong>journal </strong>and <strong>recipe book</strong>, discovering lost pages featuring location hints of ancient recipes and other secrets!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pie Making </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your ingredients to bake delicious pies step by step. Delight in seeing each unique pie\u2019s delicious result. Wonder who those pie orders are for?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a team of two, this is our passion project and we can't wait for you to enjoy your time in Portabellows! We hope to tickle your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Let Us Cook Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339000/aef8421510c0f7551304e5c8f9850e23c0aa38c4/header.jpg?t=1772051020","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2339000/1324460961/fcfa10c5802c61d65f1c31022da62bf442e09038/1753898334/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753900606","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2339000/1324460961/fcfa10c5802c61d65f1c31022da62bf442e09038/1753898334/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753900606","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2339000/1324460961/fcfa10c5802c61d65f1c31022da62bf442e09038/1753898334/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753900606","id":257040072,"name":"Reveal Trailer